# verify-delegation

Apply the verify-delegation skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- independently reproduce a delegated claim
- reject unverifiable, stale, or partial evidence
- emit a bounded verification verdict with evidence

Stop when: Black-box verification complete; evidence reviewed; capability inventory confirmed; fixed-point digest matches; refusal issued when evidence insufficient.
